 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Regular numbers",
   "texto": [
    "Up to ten have their own form: **der erste** (first), **der zweite** (second), **der dritte** (third), **der vierte** (fourth) From 20 onwards **-ste**: **der zwanzigste** (20th) is added.",
    "They decline as an adjective in front of the name or behind «am»: **am dritten Oktober** (October 3)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Dates",
   "texto": [
    "The date in German goes with ordinary: **Heute ist der dreizehnte Oktober** (today is October 13). To ask the date: **Der Wievielte ist heute?** (what date are we at?).",
    "To say «on the day of the month» with «am»: **am zwanzigsten Oktober** (October 20). Written with figures it puts a point: 20. Oktober."
   ]
  },
